    "ciphertext": "~022079059608426693252",
    "title": "<span class=\"highlight\">Brand</span> Identity <span class=\"highlight\">Designer</span> Needed for Premium Lifestyle <span class=\"highlight\">Brand</span> (Full Visual Identity & <span class=\"highlight\">Brand</span> Guidelines)",
    "description": "About the Project\nWe are launching a premium lifestyle and textile <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span>, and we are looking for a talented, senior visual <span class=\"highlight\">designer</span> to build our foundational <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> identity from the ground up.\n\nOur <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> focuses on a minimalist, clean, and high-end aesthetic. We aren't just looking for someone to draw a quick logo; we need a strategic creative partner who understands how a visual system translates seamlessly across digital platforms (like Instagram and TikTok) as well as physical touchpoints (such as product packaging, woven labels, and tags).\n\nScope of Work & Deliverables\nWe want to structure this project into clear deliverables:\n\n1: Discovery & Mood Boards – Competitor research, visual direction, and conceptual mood boards to align on the <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span>'s aesthetic.\n\n2: Core Logo System – Primary logo, secondary logo, and a sub-mark/monogram icon optimized for small spaces (like social media profile pictures or stamped tags).\n\n3: Visual System Expansion – Typography selection (primary and secondary font pairings) and a comprehensive color palette (with exact HEX, RGB, and CMYK/Pantone codes for physical manufacturing).\n\n4: <span class=\"highlight\">Brand</span> Guidelines Book – A beautifully designed, comprehensive PDF manual (15+ pages) detailing logo usage rules, clear space, typography hierarchy, and examples of the <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> applied to real-world mockups.\n\n5: Final Asset Delivery – Clean, perfectly organized vector source files (.AI, .EPS, .SVG) and web-ready formats (.PNG, .JPG).\n\nWhat We Are Looking For\nA strong portfolio demonstrating clean, high-end, or luxury <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> identity systems (please show examples of your <span class=\"highlight\">designs</span> applied to physical products or packaging, not just flat graphics).\n\nExpert-level proficiency in Adobe Illustrator, InDesign, and Photoshop.\nExcellent communication skills and a collaborative approach to feedback.\nExperience in the e-commerce, lifestyle, or premium consumer goods space is a major plus.",
